          "title": "You'll want to know: ಒಗ್ಗರಣೆ ಹಾಕು",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಒಗ್ಗರಣೆ ಹಾಕು — oggaraṇe hāku — \"to temper (fry spices in hot oil)\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಒಗ್ಗರಣೆ ಹಾಕು (oggaraṇe hāku) is oggaraṇe, \"seasoning\", which DEDR lists among Indo-Aryan loans (DEDR App. 17), and hāku, \"to put\", whose history neither DEDR nor CDIAL gives."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
